<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were weak to mostly $0.50 Lower. Demand was light on a light to moderate movement. Top $49.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  47.00-48.00 Few 48.50-49.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  42.00-47.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  37.00-42.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 39.00-41.50 Few 38.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 42.00-44.00</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 44.00-48.00 Few over 650 lbs.</p>
<p>49.00-50.00.</p>
</text>
